{
  "slug": "big-chicken-potato-breakfast-plate",
  "name": "Big chicken and potato breakfast plate",
  "description": "A large savoury breakfast plate: grated potato crisped in olive oil with mushrooms and spinach, finished with plenty of diced cooked chicken breast, in fifteen minutes.",
  "iconKey": "fork_knife",
  "instructions": [
    "Coarsely grate the potatoes and squeeze them dry in a clean towel.",
    "Warm the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat, spread the grated potato in an even layer and cook it, covered, for 6 minutes, turning once, until it is tender and golden.",
    "Push the potato to one side of the pan, add the mushrooms and the garlic and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the spinach and the diced cooked chicken breast with the salt and the black pepper and heat through for 2 minutes, until the spinach has wilted.",
    "Slide everything onto one large plate."
  ],
